@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

title EMBC ESS - Architecture Overview (from SRS)

actor "Role-based User" as User

package "Client (Angular Browser)" as Client {
  component "ClientApp" as ClientApp
  component "Router" as Router
  component "Auth Guard / Login Handling" as AuthGuard
  component "External Redirect Guard" as RedirectGuard
  component "HTTP Interceptor\n(401 handling, watchdog reset)" as HttpInterceptor
  component "NgRx Store" as Store
  component "Controlled-List Loader" as ControlledLoader
  component "Notifier" as Notifier
  component "Notification Queue <<client-side>>" as NotificationQueue
  component "Cookie Service" as CookieService

  component "Evacuee Service\n(Read)" as EvacueeService
  component "Incident-Task Service\n(Create, Read, Update)" as IncidentTaskService
  component "Organization Service\n(Create, Read, Update)" as OrgService
  component "Referral Service\n(Create, Read, Update, Delete)" as ReferralService
  component "Registration Service\n(Create, Read, Update, PDF Collection)" as RegistrationService
}

package "Backend API (.NET Core WebAPI)" as Backend {
  component "Controllers" as Controllers
  component "Domain Services" as DomainServices
  component "Auth Integration\n(SiteMinder-aware)" as AuthIntegration
  component "Entity Framework / DbContext" as EF
}

rectangle "SiteMinder" as SiteMinder

database "MS SQL Database" as MSSQL
folder "Repository SQL Scripts\n(Volunteer Deactivation, etc.)" as SQLScripts

User --> ClientApp : uses

Router --> AuthGuard : role checks
Router --> RedirectGuard : external URL routing

ClientApp ..> Store : uses
ControlledLoader --> Store : initialize data
Notifier ..> NotificationQueue : observe
ClientApp --> NotificationQueue : enqueue notifications
ClientApp ..> CookieService : get/set cookies

EvacueeService --> HttpInterceptor
IncidentTaskService --> HttpInterceptor
OrgService --> HttpInterceptor
ReferralService --> HttpInterceptor
RegistrationService --> HttpInterceptor

HttpInterceptor --> Controllers : HTTP requests

Controllers --> DomainServices
DomainServices --> EF
EF --> MSSQL

Controllers ..> AuthIntegration : authentication/authorization
AuthIntegration ..> SiteMinder : context

SQLScripts --> MSSQL : maintenance operations

ClientApp ..> SiteMinder : respects SiteMinder context

note right of HttpInterceptor
- On 401 while logged-in: log out and show session-expired page
- Reset watchdog timer on each HTTP request
end note

note top of Store
NgRx single immutable state; actions + reducers compute changes.
end note

note right of ClientApp
Module double-load diagnostic alerts developers during development.
end note

note right of Backend
Development API bypass is backend-only and enabled only in designated development environments.
end note

note bottom of MSSQL
Backup is required before executing repository SQL scripts.
end note

note bottom of NotificationQueue
Client-side queue; no external message broker/queue component required by this SRS.
end note

@enduml